    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37753" root="لطث" body-key="l">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَطَثَهُ</span></b> , (aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَطِثَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَطْثٌ</span>, L,) <i>He struck
him with the flat of the hand;</i> or, <i>with a broad
piece of wood:</i> (IAar, K:) <i>he slapped him with
his open hand;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَكَّهُ</span>; (K;) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَطَمَهُ</span>.
(TA.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَطَسَهُ</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَطَثَهُ بِحَجَرٍ</span> <i>He
threw a stone at him;</i> (K;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَطَسَهُ</span>.
(TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَطَثَهُ</span> <i>He collected it together.</i> (K.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَطَثَهُ الأَمْرُ</span>, (aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَطِثَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَطْثٌ</span>,) <i>The affair
was difficult,</i> or <i>troublesome, to him.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَطَثَهُ</span>, aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَطِثَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَطْثٌ</span>, <i>It</i> (a load, or an
affair,) <i>was heavy</i> or <i>burdensome, and hard,</i> or
<i>grievous to him.</i> (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَطَثٌ</span>, [aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَطُثَ</span></b> ,] inf. n.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَطْثٌ</span>, <i>It became corrupt.</i> (IAar, K.)

